# PRODUCTION secrets of the website Worker (bukuresipi-web) -> `bun run secrets:push` (git-ignored).
# Cloudflare never returns secret values, so this file is the only copy you can read back.
# Empty values are skipped, so a blank line never wipes a live secret. PUBLIC_* lines are build settings, never pushed.
# None needed today: the site is static and reaches the API by service binding (wrangler.jsonc "services").
# Add one when worker/index.ts reads it, e.g.:
# TURNSTILE_SECRET=
